{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Gas-fired and nuclear power stations can generally provide electricity independently of the immediate weather, although they require fuel, maintenance and occasionally experience outages. Coal and oil can also provide controllable generation where plants remain in service. Wind and solar output depend on weather and time of day. Hydroelectric generation depends on water availability, but reservoirs can make its output relatively controllable. Tidal generation is variable yet highly predictable because tidal cycles can be forecast.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": true}", "duration": 39.653878, "words": [["Gas-fired", 0.0], ["and", 0.998], ["nuclear", 1.335], ["power", 1.834], ["stations", 2.183], ["can", 2.81], ["generally", 3.111], ["provide", 3.669], ["electricity", 4.249], ["independently", 5.166], ["of", 6.269], ["the", 6.478], ["immediate", 6.629], ["weather,", 7.175], ["although", 7.744], ["they", 8.324], ["require", 8.557], ["fuel,", 9.16], ["maintenance", 9.88], ["and", 10.728], ["occasionally", 11.146], ["experience", 12.016], ["outages.", 12.91], ["Coal", 14.06], ["and", 14.571], ["oil", 14.872], ["can", 15.29], ["also", 15.557], ["provide", 15.987], ["controllable", 16.532], ["generation", 17.264], ["where", 18.181], ["plants", 18.518], ["remain", 19.005], ["in", 19.458], ["service.", 19.609], ["Wind", 20.468], ["and", 20.898], ["solar", 21.142], ["output", 21.594], ["depend", 22.105], ["on", 22.628], ["weather", 22.837], ["and", 23.289], ["time", 23.556], ["of", 23.87], ["day.", 24.032], ["Hydroelectric", 24.752], ["generation", 25.762], ["depends", 26.517], ["on", 27.028], ["water", 27.237], ["availability,", 27.713], ["but", 28.874], ["reservoirs", 29.176], ["can", 29.919], ["make", 30.151], ["its", 30.406], ["output", 30.627], ["relatively", 31.312], ["controllable.", 32.043], ["Tidal", 33.1], ["generation", 33.599], ["is", 34.377], ["variable", 34.691], ["yet", 35.492], ["highly", 35.817],